 SystemAge™ Test ends with a plan.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"nk-text-base text-nk-cold-brown-400\",\"children\":\"By analyzing 21 body systems independently, the test identifies which systems are driving your aging and where acceleration is occurring. This system-level precision makes targeted intervention possible, directing action where it can have the greatest impact.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-10 text-center lg:gap-6 lg:text-left\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"nk-text-base text-nk-cold-brown-400\",\"children\":\"The result is a plan built around your biology, not a generic playbook. For those working with a longevity professional, it provides a foundation for more precise, system-specific protocols.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"nk-text-base text-nk-cold-brown-400\",\"children\":\"Retest over time to measure how each system responds, validate what is working, and refine what is not.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"55:I[32207,[\"2821\",\"static/chunks/2821-9b6ca5eba886e2a6.js\",\"5889\",\"static/chunks/5889-e987f21560aaf28e.js\",\"1356\",\"static/chunks/1356-5c8c2e2fb753b8c7.js\",\"7422\",\"static/chunks/7422-7217ed2b5be12ba6.js\",\"6747\",\"static/chunks/6747-98b0bd29e6fb43ae.js\",\"9080\",\"static/chunks/9080-244df791d81dc0fe.js\",\"5049\",\"static/chunks/5049-f5dc217ee43b13ef.js\",\"3381\",\"static/chunks/3381-9fd7015f72c1f80d.js\",\"610\",\"static/chunks/610-b6f34976b13101da.js\",\"4413\",\"static/chunks/4413-6655792e00732f0a.js\",\"2261\",\"static/chunks/2261-590a8231ca24d550.js\",\"7321\",\"static/chunks/7321-718f54d05cb30cd1.js\",\"8423\",\"static/chunks/8423-3f94c56cd96e703c.js\",\"2044\",\"static/chunks/2044-592c1f43611bfeac.js\",\"6389\",\"static/chunks/6389-3a5fbfe3d8748e63.js\",\"5355\",\"static/chunks/5355-fe3e19517f6c5df1.js\",\"266\",\"static/chunks/266-dcbd378fe4c88330.js\